/* The host services an eApp image imports, module by module, in the order of
 * the host's tables: the interface id of each module and every function it
 * exports, named as in the symbols header. The loader fills the import list
 * only when a module's whole table is imported, so each list is complete; the
 * OpenGLES and Metadata entries the reversing has not named yet carry their
 * table index. */

